# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deny by default.
#
# This directory is the live skill store (~/.agents/skills points here),
# so it also holds skills downloaded from third parties. Those stay on
# disk for local use but are deliberately NOT published here: they belong
# to their original authors and are re-installed from source instead.
#
# To publish one of your own skills, add it under "Your own skills".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# Repository files
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/skills.json
!/install-skills.sh

# Your own skills
!/design-system/
